{"id":55,"date":"2013-06-15T22:29:41","date_gmt":"2013-06-15T20:29:41","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/192.168.1.11\/?page_id=55"},"modified":"2018-04-27T13:19:18","modified_gmt":"2018-04-27T11:19:18","slug":"le-vercors","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/gite-du-galli.fr\/le-vercors\/","title":{"rendered":"Le Vercors"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2 style=\"padding-left: 60px;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-623\" src=\"http:\/\/gite-du-galli.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/Vercors_001-e1427732477224.jpg\" alt=\"Vercors_001\" width=\"800\" height=\"276\" srcset=\"https:\/\/gite-du-galli.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/Vercors_001-e1427732477224.jpg 800w, https:\/\/gite-du-galli.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/Vercors_001-e1427732477224-300x104.jpg 300w, https:\/\/gite-du-galli.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2015\/03\/Vercors_001-e1427732477224-250x86.jpg 250w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/><\/h2>\n<h2 style=\"padding-left: 60px;\">Le <span style=\"color: #008000;\"><a href=\"http:\/\/fr.wikipedia.org\/wiki\/Massif_du_Vercors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">massif du Vercors<\/span><\/a><\/span> est un massif des Pr\u00e9alpes, \u00e0 cheval sur les d\u00e9partements de l&rsquo;Is\u00e8re et de la Dr\u00f4me, sommet\u00a0culminant \u00e0 2 341 m\u00e8tres au Grand Veymont.<\/h2>\n<h2><span style=\"color: #003300;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">cliquez sur les liens verts:<\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"http:\/\/www.ladrometourisme.com\/fr\/je-decouvre\/top-10\/le-parc-naturel-du-vercors.html\"><strong><span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration: underline;\">http:\/\/vercors.fr\/<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/p>\n<p>soit par le col des <span style=\"color: #333333;\">limouches<\/span><a href=\"http:\/\/http:\/\/www.france-voyage.com\/villes-villages\/le-chaffal-7278\/col-limouches-28133.htm\">,<\/a> soit par le col de <a href=\"http:\/\/antonioli.unblog.fr\/2010\/07\/06\/mardi-le-col-de-tourniol-par-ses-2-faces\/\"><strong><span style=\"color: #008000;\">Tourniol<\/span><\/strong><\/a>, visitez<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"> <strong><a href=\"http:\/\/www.leoncel-abbaye.com\/\"><span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration: underline;\">l&rsquo;Abbaye Cistercienne de Leonce<\/span>l<\/a><span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration: underline;\">\u00a0<\/span><\/strong><\/span>(\u00e0 30 km du sud-est de Romans sur Isere)et .. continuez <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"http:\/\/www.france-voyage.com\/villes-villages\/ombleze-7443\/col-bataille-28056.htm\"><strong><span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration: underline;\">au col de le bataille<\/span><\/strong><\/a>&#8230;<\/span>.<\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-271\" title=\"Tunnel\" src=\"http:\/\/gite-du-galli.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2013\/06\/facteur-cheval.jpg\" alt=\"Tunnel\" width=\"85\" height=\"65\" \/><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>de l&rsquo;autre c\u00f4t\u00e9 du tunnel, apres avoir pass\u00e9 le col.. chemin \u00e0 droite en bas du <span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"http:\/\/www.bivouak.net\/topos\/course.php?id_course=5203&amp;id_sport=2\"><span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration: underline;\">Roc de Toulau<\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/span>\u00a0 suivre le GR93 en dessous de ce chemin,ou le chemin lui-m\u00eame.. randonn\u00e9e \u00ab\u00a0<strong><span style=\"color: #339966;\"><a href=\"http:\/\/www.rando-drome.com\/plateau-ambel-vercors\/\"><span style=\"color: #339966;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">d<\/span><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">u plateau d&rsquo;Ambe<\/span>l<\/span><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/strong>\u00ab\u00a0..<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><a href=\"http:\/\/www.royans.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">en passant par le Royans<\/span>,<\/span><\/strong>\u00a0<\/a><\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-221 size-thumbnail\" src=\"http:\/\/gite-du-galli.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2013\/06\/pont-150x150.jpg\" alt=\"pont\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" srcset=\"https:\/\/gite-du-galli.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2013\/06\/pont-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/gite-du-galli.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2013\/06\/pont-48x48.jpg 48w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" \/><\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\">route de Combe Laval, en partant de st laurent en Royans,<\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-220 size-thumbnail\" src=\"http:\/\/gite-du-galli.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2013\/06\/laval-150x150.jpg\" alt=\"laval\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" srcset=\"https:\/\/gite-du-galli.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2013\/06\/laval-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/gite-du-galli.fr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2013\/06\/laval-48x48.jpg 48w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>les maisons suspendues de Pont en Royans<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><a href=\"http:\/\/www.ladrometourisme.com\/fr\/je-decouvre\/stations-de-la-drome.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #008000; text-decoration: underline;\">\u00c9t\u00e9 comme hiver,<\/span><\/a><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong><a href=\"http:\/\/www.bivouak.net\/topos\/liste_sommet.php?id_massif=3&amp;sommet=&amp;id_wpt=&amp;submit=Filtrer&amp;sid=&amp;id_sport=2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span style=\"color: #008000; text-de